  dialogueGroupName: Merchant_Phi
  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3eaca1f8717750a42a1bc8e2ee5e7c9c, type: 2}
  textLine:
  - Hello,there.This is Lumio Grocery / Blacksmith Shop.You are....,I feel like I've
    seen you somewhere before?....Never mind,Let me introduce.People call us the
    Lumio siblings. Due to my appearance, my brother often travels around doing business
    with me.Want something?
  - You must have talked to my brother over there. If not, it's fine. There's not
    much to chat with that old man.
  - There's a guy named Travis along the way. He seems odd, you'd better watch out
    for him. You may or may not have spoken to him. Either way, stay cautious in
    this world.
  - If you want to reach to the next area, you can go forwad to the Gate of Pacha,
    and use the corresponding key to open it, ......You should have the key, right?
  actionLine: 
